 Msg: A privileged service was called.\r\r\n\r\r\nSubject:\r\r\n\tSecurity ID:\t\tS-1-5-21-2079883792-3656946353-94592483\r\nID: evt-01823, Code: 4690, Host: WS-05.corp.example, Msg: An attempt was made to duplicate a handle to an object.\r\r\n\r\r\nSubject:\r\r\n\tSecurity ID:\t\tS-1-5-21-2079883\r\nID: evt-01825, Code: 4658, Host: WS-05.corp.example, Msg: The handle to an object was closed.\r\r\n\r\r\nSubject :\r\r\n\tSecurity ID:\t\tS-1-5-21-2079883792-3656946353-9459\r\nID: evt-01827, Code: 4656, Host: WS-05.corp.example, Msg: A handle to an object was requested.\r\r\n\r\r\nSubject:\r\r\n\tSecurity ID:\t\tS-1-5-21-2079883792-3656946353-9459\r\nID: evt-01828, Code: 4663, Host: WS-05.corp.example, Msg: An attempt was made to access an object.\r\r\n\r\r\nSubject:\r\r\n\tSecurity ID:\t\tS-1-5-21-2079883792-3656946353-\r\nID: evt-01831, Code: 4658, Host: WS-05.corp.example, Msg: The handle to an object was closed.\r\r\n\r\r\nSubject :\r\r\n\tSecurity ID:\t\tS-1-5-21-2079883792-3656946353-9459\r\n"]
