Windows® Operating System\r\r\nCompany: Microsoft Corporation\r\r\nOriginalFileName: NETUTILS.DLL\r\r\nHashes: SHA1=F2859AF15CED4F162359CC8C1BA1B1FE85DC8867,MD5=56B24BF15E6E88A2D6EF9AFC26BF7FCF,SHA256=74DC0C738188BBF385E9C3295C9904A6CEF4A947AFB71F2A0825037BBB27C92A,IMPHASH=06BB7C9ADD27BBA7B9DE3ADCE76673AB\r\r\nSigned: true\r\r\nSignature: Microsoft Windows\r\r\nSignatureStatus: Valid\r\nevt-01855|7|2026-05-06T00:00:44.105Z||||Image loaded:\r\r\nRuleName: -\r\r\nUtcTime: 2020-09-04 20:10:22.853\r\r\nProcessGuid: {860ba2e3-9f2e-5f52-2a03-000000000400}\r\r\nProcessId: 9152\r\r\nImage: C:\\Windows\\System32\\whoami.exe\r\r\nImageLoaded: C:\\Windows\\System32\\whoami.exe\r\r\nFileVersion: 10.0.18362.1 (WinBuild.160101.0800)\r\r\nDescription: whoami - displays logged on user information\r\r\nProduct: Microsoft® Windows® Operating System\r\r\nCompany: Microsoft Corporation\r\r\nOriginalFileName: whoami.exe\r\r\nHashes: SHA1=8F1F9E265911956C7F8F3861C34DEF9B8FA63813,MD5=2EEEEC89E705F73FFBCAE014E1828788,SHA256=A8A4C4719113B071BB50D67F6E12C188B92C70EEAFDFCD6F5DA69B6AAA99A7FD,IMPHASH=7FF0758B766F747CE57DFAC70743FB88\r\r\nSigned: true\r\r\nSignature: Microsoft Windows\r\r\nSignatureStatus: Valid\r\nevt-01856|7|2026-05-06T00:00:44.105Z||||Image loaded:\r\r\nRuleName: -\r\r\nUtcTime: 2020-09-04 20:10:22.868\r\r\nProcessGuid: {860ba2e3-9f2e-5f52-2a03-000000000400}\r\r\nProcessId: 9152\r\r\nImage: C:\\Windows\\System32\\whoami.exe\r\r\nImageLoaded: C:\\Windows\\System32\\authz.dll\r\r\nFileVersion: 10.0.18362.1 (WinBuild.160101.0800)\r\r\nDescription: Authorization Framework\r\r\nProduct: Microsoft® Windows® Operating System\r\r\nCompany: Microsoft Corporation\r\r\nOriginalFileName: authz.dll\r\r\nHashes: SHA1=A9D0855857DD0A946BC2B5982353574776EC957A,MD5=984173FF935793794A817ABA374B8B1B,SHA256=AA6F5C2741E76F614932188DDF88320417B40C8DDACF2B044F52D7759FD612FD,IMPHASH=2B609AAA2143BB40347912D3E7AC6AB0\r\r\nSigned: true\r\r\nSignature: Microsoft Windows\r\r\nSignatureStatus: Valid\r\nevt