[235.645484, "o", "Process Create Sysmon (1): ['evt-00073', 'evt-00259', 'evt-00289', 'evt-01820']\r\nProcess Create Security (4688): ['evt-00247', 'evt-00328', 'evt-00343', 'evt-01817']\r\nNetwork Sysmon (3): ['evt-01478']\r\nNetwork Security (5156/5158): []\r\nDNS Sysmon (22): ['evt-01651']\r\nPowerShell Script (4103/4104): []\r\nPipe Sysmon (17/18): ['evt-01107', 'evt-01816', 'evt-01818']\r\nFile Sysmon (11): ['evt-01022', 'evt-01023', 'evt-01098', 'evt-01723']\r\nRegistry Set Sysmon (13): ['evt-00234', 'evt-00235', 'evt-00236', 'evt-00237', 'evt-00238', 'evt-00239', 'evt-00240', 'evt-00241', 'evt-00265']\r\nRegistry Other Sysmon (12): 339 events\r\nProcess Term Sysmon (5): ['evt-00272', 'evt-01858']\r\nProcess Access Sysmon (10): 4 events\r\nSecurity Other: 217 events\r\n"]
